/Title (For a phased-in pre-existing condition sharing need, the sharing amounts are cumulative. For example, if a member receives $5,000 in sharing for a pre-existing condition during Year 1, they would have up to $25,000 of additional sharing available for that same pre-existing condition in Year 2. If they use the $25k in Year 2, then in Year 3, they have $45k toward the same pre-existing need. In Year 4, for the same pre-existing need, they will be eligible for $75K in sharing \(150-75\). The maximum sharing for a repeat need in years 1-4 is $75k.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1142 0 R
/Prev 1185 0 R
/Next 1163 0 R
>>
endobj
